      {v | sgA (paperDesignP 13108) c a v < rowSigma} ∂BstLean.Part161.muI 13108 ≤ lowMassBudget) :
    rootFLH (splitLocationWidth c) splitResidualWidth eta hqCentreCap (85 / 100) (64 / 100)
